{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["A veil — a garment so called, and the vav in it is essential, like the vav of מקוה ישראל, and likewise the vav of סותה is essential; and they are two garments and two forms. And so Dunash interpreted, and the judgment is with him."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {0 "'Two garments and two forms' (שני מלבושים הם ושני גזירות): Rashbam notes that מסוה and סותה, though similarly spelled, are two distinct garments of two distinct morphological patterns."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:58.582048118Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}